                  "rrtV2InlineElementsJson": null,
                  "html": null,
                  "text": null,
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Good afternoon, Maria. You weren’t at the presentation about energy conservation this morning. Did you get to the conference late?\\nB: Yes, I just arrived. My plane was delayed for over 2 hours in New York. Was there a laptop hooked up for that presentation? I’m presenting my research findings this afternoon, and I’ll need a laptop to show some images.\\nA: Yes, I’m sure the earlier presenter used a laptop. He showed us lots of images and graphics during his talk.\\nB: That’s good to hear. Well, I need to sign in at the conference presenter’s booth. I’ll catch up with you later.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
